/storage/app/backups

# FontAwesome Pro web bundle — 1.1 GB / ~170k files of licensed third-party
# assets. Restore it from your Font Awesome account rather than from git.
#
# Both locations are listed because the bundle has lived in each. A path-
# anchored rule stops matching the moment the folder moves, and the only
# symptom is that it silently becomes committable again — which is how it
# got into history the first time. The individual icons the app actually
# uses are vendored under resources/icons/ instead.
/html/fontawesome-pro-plus-7.3.1-web
/fontawesome-pro-plus-7.3.1-web
